## NOTE: The browser does not need the payment NEXT_PUBLIC_* values to be inlined at build time: it fetches the
## publishable key, NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_DYNAMIC_PRICING, NEXT_PUBLIC_DEMO and the configured providers from
